---
{
  title: "reject_prompt"
}
---
### NAME

    reject_prompt() - Determines whether a response to a prompt is a
    refusal.

### SYNOPSIS

    int reject_prompt( string str );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determines whether a response to a prompt is a refusal.

    Case is ignored, as with `accept_prompt()`.

### PARAMETERS

    str  (string)
         The response to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the response refuses, 0 if not.

### EXAMPLE

    {{di1}}reject_prompt("No")  // 1
    reject_prompt("yes") // 0
    reject_prompt("wat") // 0{{di0}}
